  "question": {
    "text": "The fundamental frequency of a closed organ pipe of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> is equal to the second overtone of an organ pipe open at both the ends. The length of the organ pipe open at both the ends is"
